53
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:21,633
Which shape comes next?

54
00:01:21,633 --> 00:01:22,200
A.

55
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,333
A triangle,

56
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:23,900
B.

57
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:25,000
A square,

58
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:25,567
C.

59
00:01:25,567 --> 00:01:26,700
A circle,

60
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:27,833
or D.

61
00:01:27,833 --> 00:01:28,967
A pentagon?

62
00:01:28,967 --> 00:01:30,100
Five seconds!

63
00:01:35,867 --> 00:01:37,067
TIME'S UP!

64
00:01:37,733 --> 00:01:39,167
The answer is...

65
00:01:39,167 --> 00:01:39,667
A,

66
00:01:39,667 --> 00:01:40,600
