69
00:01:44,467 --> 00:01:45,400
pentagon five,

70
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,367
square four,

71
00:01:46,367 --> 00:01:49,267
so next is the triangle with

72
00:01:49,267 --> 00:01:50,200
three sides.

73
00:01:51,367 --> 00:01:51,767
So,

74
00:01:51,767 --> 00:01:53,800
are you smart or fart?

75
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:56,233
Count up your correct answers to

76
00:01:56,233 --> 00:01:57,433
